        {
          "text": "Maze haza Abayuda bavuye muri Antiyokiya no muri Ikoniyo; bamaze kwosha ishengero, batera Paulo amabuye, bamukwegera inyuma y’igisagara, bagira ngo yāpfuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
